      "value": "<p><em>This black leather necklace is set with a golden representation of a scarab beetle.</em></p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> Only a beastheart's companion or an animal can wear this necklace. While wearing this necklace, the creature's Reason score is 0 unless it would otherwise be higher. The creature can speak any language they know, and another creature who knows a language can teach that language to the creature as a respite activity. When the creature speaks, their voice issues from the scarab on the necklace.</p>",
